INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(5956,'https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/vera-cpu-highest-throughput-fastest-agents/','https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/vera-cpu-highest-throughput-fastest-agents','Vera Delivers the Best of Both Worlds: Highest Throughput and Fastest Agents','veradeliversthebestofbothworldshighestthroughputandfastestagents','nvidia_blog','NVIDIA blog','en','2026-11-05T20:00:41Z','2026-11-06T04:01:44Z','AI agents do more than generate answers. They search for information, query databases, write and test code and take action. Each of those steps relies on a CPU, with agents moving between GPU reasoning and CPU execution throughout a task. As businesses put more agents to work, AI factories need CPUs that can execute those […]',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(5957,'https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-life-chris-alexiuk/','https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-life-chris-alexiuk','The Wizard of Open Weights: Chris Alexiuk Makes AI Easy With Open Models','thewizardofopenweightschrisalexiukmakesaieasywithopenmodels','nvidia_blog','NVIDIA blog','en','2026-11-05T16:00:05Z','2026-11-06T04:01:44Z','Chris Alexiuk has a simple rule about open source AI: If you believe in it, be loud about it. “We should be shouting about this technology from the rooftops,” said Alexiuk, a Toronto-based senior product research engineer in deep learning at NVIDIA who specializes in making open large language models (LLMs) practical for working developers. […]',2.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(5958,'https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/memory-full-stack-codesign/','https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/memory-full-stack-codesign','More Performance From Every Byte: How Full-Stack Codesign Solves AI’s Memory Challenge','moreperformancefromeverybytehowfullstackcodesignsolvesaismemorychallenge','nvidia_blog','NVIDIA blog','en','2026-11-05T16:00:00Z','2026-11-06T04:01:44Z','Larger models, longer contexts and agentic applications are increasing GPU memory pressure while supply tightens and prices rise — a trend expected to continue through the near term. NVIDIA works closely with memory partners to rapidly adopt the latest memory technologies. NVIDIA was first to adopt HBM3e and HBM4 technologies into an accelerated computing stack. […]',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(5959,'https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/geforce-now-thursday-hogwarts-legacy-dlss-5/','https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/geforce-now-thursday-hogwarts-legacy-dlss-5','‘Hogwarts Legacy’ Gets a Magical NVIDIA DLSS 5 Upgrade on GeForce NOW','hogwartslegacygetsamagicalnvidiadlss5upgradeongeforcenow','nvidia_blog','NVIDIA blog','en','2026-11-05T14:00:34Z','2026-11-06T04:01:44Z','Hogwarts Legacy receives an NVIDIA DLSS 5 upgrade with 3D-Guided Neural Rendering today, bringing lifelike lighting and materials to the wizarding world on GeForce NOW. Blizzard Entertainment’s World of Warcraft: Forever also opens a new chapter in Azeroth, with a launch-week access reward available for GeForce NOW members. Meanwhile, Ubisoft brings fresh challenges with expansions […]',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(5960,'https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/blog/formally-verifying-agent-written-full-stack-web-apps-with-pdd-kit/','https://microsoft.com/en-us/research/blog/formally-verifying-agent-written-full-stack-web-apps-with-pdd-kit','Formally verifying agent-written full-stack web apps with PDD Kit','formallyverifyingagentwrittenfullstackwebappswithpddkit','msr_blog','Microsoft Research blog','en','2026-11-05T16:00:00Z','2026-11-06T04:01:45Z','AI agents can generate code at a scale that’s hard for humans to review line-by-line. PDD Kit helps ensure the code is doing what the developer intended by creating formal specifications and testing against them. It converts developer intent into a Verus specification, proves AI-generated code meets it for every input, and uses tests where proofs aren''t practical. Developers review intent, not every line. The post Formally verifying agent-written full-stack web apps with PDD Kit appeared first on Microsoft Research .',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(5961,'https://eos.org/research-spotlights/scientists-zero-in-on-tiny-particles-to-improve-weather-and-air-quality-forecasts-chinese','https://eos.org/research-spotlights/scientists-zero-in-on-tiny-particles-to-improve-weather-and-air-quality-forecasts-chinese','聚焦微小颗粒，提升天气和空气质量预报能力','聚焦微小颗粒提升天气和空气质量预报能力','eos','Eos (AGU)','en','2026-11-05T13:42:34Z','2026-11-06T04:01:45Z','这张由美国国家航空航天局（NASA）卫星搭载的中分辨率成像光谱仪（MODIS）于2024年10月拍摄的图像显示，中国东部上空弥漫着一层厚厚的气溶胶霾——这些气溶胶主要源自车辆和工业等人类活动。图片来源： MODIS Land Rapid Response Team, NASA GSFC',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(5962,'https://eos.org/articles/temperature-swings-are-melting-the-ice-in-lava-beds-national-monuments-caves','https://eos.org/articles/temperature-swings-are-melting-the-ice-in-lava-beds-national-monuments-caves','Temperature Swings Are Melting the Ice in Lava Beds National Monument’s Caves','temperatureswingsaremeltingtheiceinlavabedsnationalmonumentscaves','eos','Eos (AGU)','en','2026-11-05T13:42:13Z','2026-11-06T04:01:45Z','Many of the caves in California’s Lava Beds National Monument, such as Valentine Cave, are lava tubes. Some also contain ice formations. Credit: Peter Thoeny/Flickr , CC BY-NC-SA 2.0',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(5963,'https://eos.org/editor-highlights/trash-to-treasure-increased-soil-phosphorus-in-farmed-urban-soils','https://eos.org/editor-highlights/trash-to-treasure-increased-soil-phosphorus-in-farmed-urban-soils','Trash to Treasure? Increased Soil Phosphorus in Farmed Urban Soils','trashtotreasureincreasedsoilphosphorusinfarmedurbansoils','eos','Eos (AGU)','en','2026-11-05T13:00:00Z','2026-11-06T04:01:45Z','A conceptual diagram showcasing how the likely pathway by which urban influence increases soil phosphorus content. The size of the calcium-bound phosphorus fraction (P Ca ) is consistently higher in urban contexts and greatly reduced in non-urban soils. Credit: Asabere and Sauer [2026] , Figure 8',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
