INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6317,'https://www.hpcwire.com/off-the-wire/women-in-hpc-introduces-its-sc26-rising-stars-cohort/','https://hpcwire.com/off-the-wire/women-in-hpc-introduces-its-sc26-rising-stars-cohort','Women in HPC Introduces Its SC26 Rising Stars Cohort','womeninhpcintroducesitssc26risingstarscohort','hpcwire','HPCwire','en','2026-11-07T00:58:16Z','2026-11-07T04:03:45Z','Nov. 6, 2026 — Women in High Performance Computing (WHPC) has announced its 12 Rising Stars for SC26. The program recognizes exceptional early-career researchers from underrepresented groups for their research contributions and individual excellence. Applications for the Rising Star program undergo a competitive peer-review process, typically with an acceptance rate of less than 50%. As […] The post Women in HPC Introduces Its SC26 Rising Stars Cohort appeared first on HPCwire .',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
