INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6907,'https://www.theverge.com/tech/1029773/disney-adobe-generative-ai-partnership','https://theverge.com/tech/1029773/disney-adobe-generative-ai-partnership','Disney and Adobe are building generative AI tools together','disneyandadobearebuildinggenerativeaitoolstogether','theverge_ai','The Verge - AI','en','2026-11-09T15:38:56Z','2026-11-10T04:04:59Z','The Walt Disney Company has teamed up with Adobe to develop proprietary "artist-led" generative AI models to support Disney''s production pipeline. The multiyear partnership was announced today at Adobe''s MAX conference, and it will see Adobe providing Disney with early access to its latest technologies for everything from Disney''s theme parks and cruise line to […]',2.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6908,'https://www.hpcwire.com/2026/11/09/behind-radical-ais-flywheel-powering-materials-discovery-at-sandia-labs/','https://hpcwire.com/2026/11/09/behind-radical-ais-flywheel-powering-materials-discovery-at-sandia-labs','Behind Radical AI’s Flywheel Powering Materials Discovery at Sandia Labs','behindradicalaisflywheelpoweringmaterialsdiscoveryatsandialabs','hpcwire','HPCwire','en','2026-11-10T00:18:25Z','2026-11-10T04:04:59Z','AI is supercharging scientific discovery. There’s little doubt about that. However, in some cases, you can get too much of a good thing. This is particularly true in materials science, where AI can create a glut of new hypotheses to test, thereby creating new bottlenecks. An AI for science startup called Radical AI is hoping […] The post Behind Radical AI’s Flywheel Powering Materials Discovery at Sandia Labs appeared first on HPCwire .',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
