ainfall and extreme event forecasts", "url": "https://kchcomunicacion.com/2026/10/16/ia-del-mit-revoluciona-pronosticos-de-lluvias-y-eventos-extremos"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-20T03:01:22Z", "source_name": "microsoft.com", "title": "New AI framework bridges a critical gap in mid-range weather forecasts - Microsoft Research", "title_en": "New AI framework bridges a critical gap in mid-range weather forecasts - Microsoft Research", "url": "https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/story/new-ai-framework-bridges-a-critical-gap-in-mid-range-weather-forecasts/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-21T03:10:06Z", "source_name": "diariobitcoin.com", "title": "MIT desarrolla una técnica de IA para mejorar pronósticos meteorológicos de hasta seis semanas - DiarioBitcoin", "title_en": "MIT develops an AI technique to improve weather forecasts up to six weeks ahead", "url": "https://diariobitcoin.com/tecnologia/mit-desarrolla-una-tecnica-de-ia-para-mejorar-pronosticos-meteorologicos-de-hasta-seis-semanas"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-23T03:09:36Z", "source_name": "tiempo.com", "title": "Científicos del MIT rompen el límite de los 14 días con un modelo meteorológico capaz de prever el tiempo a largo plazo", "title_en": "MIT scientists break the 14-day barrier with a weather model capable of long-range forecasting", "url": "https://tiempo.com/noticias/actualidad/se-desarrollo-un-nuevo-modelo-meteorologico-podria-finalmente-hacer-pronosticos-a-mas-de-dos-semanas.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-24T04:06:46Z", "source_name": "nationalgeographic.com.es", "title": "El avance que desafía los límites del caos atmosférico: una IA afina las previsiones hasta seis semanas antes", "title_en": "The advance that challenges the limits of atmospheric chaos: an AI sharpens forecasts up to six weeks ahead", "url": "https://www.nationalgeographic.com.es/ciencia/mit-rompe-barrera-14-dias-ia-permite-anticipar-tiempo-hasta-6-semanas-y