arch targets longer warning lead times than the typical 30 minutes offered by current hail warning systems.", "system_names": [], "techniques": ["ml_dl"], "title": "To better predict destructive hail, these scientists are turning to AI", "value_added": "Aims to improve prediction of destructive hailstorms beyond the roughly 30-minute warning lead time of current systems.", "value_types": ["accuracy", "lead_time"], "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
